The Centre has issued a notice to @elonmusk -owned @X, directing it to remove and curb obscene and sexually explicit content generated by its #AI chatbot @grok and to submit a compliance report within 72 hours.

@GoI_MeitY said such content violates the IT Act, 2000 and IT Rules, 2021, and warned that continued lapses could lead to legal action and withdrawal of safe harbour protection under Section 79. The government has asked X to strengthen safety guardrails and moderation mechanisms for Grok.

